  "narrative": {
    "intro": "General Dynamics Ots Wilkes Barre reported federal contract obligations of $532M in FY2026 to date. General Dynamics Ots Wilkes Barre received 27 awards so far, with an average award size of $19.7M. General Dynamics Ots Wilkes Barre obligations are down 9.2% year over year. General Dynamics Ots Wilkes Barre has a multiyear profile that shows earlier peaks: FY23 obligations were $833M, FY24 obligations were $595M, and FY25 obligations were $586M. General Dynamics Ots Wilkes Barre top markets in FY2026 to date are Ammunition (except Small Arms) Manufacturing at $389M and Facilities Support Services at $143M. General Dynamics Ots Wilkes Barre current-year totals are partial, reflecting fiscal year to date obligations rather than full-year totals. General Dynamics Ots Wilkes Barre average award size and award count reflect the mix of contract actions during this partial year, and the company continues to derive most obligations from the two top NAICS markets listed.",
