      {
        "heading": "Where do General Dynamics Ots Wilkes Barre's obligations concentrate by market?",
        "body": "Ammunition (except Small Arms) Manufacturing is the largest market for General Dynamics Ots Wilkes Barre at $389M in FY2026 to date. Facilities Support Services is the next largest market for General Dynamics Ots Wilkes Barre at $143M. These two markets account for the majority of the reported FY2026 obligations."
